[00:00] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'Accessing the photo album. In the album, you can edit, export, and manage your footage. Open the Anti-gravity app and go to the album. Select the footage you want to edit to open the editor.'

[00:12] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'Drag with one finger to adjust the screen\'s orientation. Pinch or spread with two fingers to adjust the field of view. The area at the bottom of the screen is'

[00:25] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'for perspective editing. You\'ll find several options here to help explore your footage. Distortion correction, adjust the display for a more natural look. Perspective selection, lets you choose'

[00:39] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'the flight\'s point of view. Goggles view, adjust the scene to match the perspective from your flight'

[00:53] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'goggles. AI perspective, intelligently generates camera angles based on the scene\'s content. Common, easy-to-use shortcuts are'

[01:05] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'located on the left side of the screen. Trim, adjust the start and end points of your footage to shorten its length. Segment trim, lets you select and'

[01:18] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'combine multiple segments from the original footage into one clip. Keyframes, set keyframes at different points in your footage. The view will'

[01:30] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'move smoothly between them. Screenshot, save a single frame as a standard image, live photo, or panoramic'

[01:42] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'photo. Highlight segments, the app intelligently analyzes your footage and suggests multiple highlight clips for'

[01:54] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'you to choose from. Mark, add a marker to a specific point in time.'

[02:06] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'This marker will appear on the timeline during more complex edits. Screen recording, when you start recording, your footage'

[02:19] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'will play automatically. During playback, you can adjust the camera angle or use the tools at the bottom to add camera movements with one tap. After stopping, you can quickly export'

[02:38] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'the new clip. One-tap video creation, access built-in templates, choose a theme, and the app will automatically add effects,'

[02:50] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'transitions, and music to create a video instantly. Edit, tap cut a segment to select one or more clips.'

[03:02] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'Tap edit export to access more advanced editing tools for your selection. For even more options, tap go to more'

[03:16] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'edits. When you\'re finished editing, tap the export button in the top right corner, choose your resolution, and export the final video.'
